  <name>V1Scope</name>
  <type>bddocumentation:V1Scope</type>
  <baseType>core:Documentation</baseType>
  <is>What BlockDoc V1 includes and accepts</is>

  <documentation>V1 ships static HTML by package/FQN hierarchy with:

    • Registry name blockdoc; accepts library, corpus, auto
    • Options: siteMode (merged|perLibrary), outLayout (fqn|package), includeNonExported
    • Block pages, site index, package indexes (fqn layout)
    • Type links for known named FQNs; member tables; composition trees
    • Control gate: renders without requiring Stage-2 semantic success

    Not V1 (see ScopeExclusions): dependency graphs, richer navigation chrome on block pages,
    authored XML example surfaces, package-layout collision tooling.</documentation>
  <references>
    <see type="bddocumentation:PublicApi" relation="ReadNext"></see>
  </references>

</block>
